<title>PORTUGAL: Centralcer takes stake in Spanish firm.</title>
<headline>Centralcer takes stake in Spanish firm.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese drinks company Centralcer-Central de Cervejas said it had acquired a 9.53 percent stake in the capital of Spanish beer company Compania Andaluza de Cervezas SA.</p>
<p>&quot;The purchase of a stake in the capital of Compania Andaluza de Cervezas SA by Centralcer is aimed at pursuing a strategy of expansion and the internationalisation of its activities, in order to permit the consolidation of synergies between the two companies, considering that they carry out their activities in geographically close areas,&quot; a statement said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
